# The UI image build (ui/Dockerfile) copies package.json, the lockfile and ui/. Everything else in this repository is
# either a Pi extension the UI does not import, a test the image must not ship, or a scratch directory that would leak
# into the image layer. `node_modules` is excluded because the image installs its own tree with `npm ci`, and copying
# a local one instead is how a laptop's tree ends up in production.
node_modules
.git
.gitignore
.pi
.slopyphus
test
extensions
memory
hack
*.log
.ctx.mjs
.*.mjs
.*.cjs
